    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A <i>simple</i> game made using RPG Paper Maker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Void. An obscure wasteland of thoughts and concepts trying to exist without reason. You play as null an incomplete being trying to fill it's empty heart.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get erased. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your heart break endlessly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empty the Void.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become whole.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End it all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >null HEART break is a lovely RPG 4 empty souls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based battle featuring animated enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original hand drawn art filled with character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming Soundtrack that captures the feelings of the void.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartfelt story that questions what it means to be alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies through the games Logic Point System.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an empty world filled with different concepts and ideas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with characters so charming you'd think they had a soul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View treasured memories of the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let go of those you hold dear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break your Heart.</p></li></ul>",
